E.130.100 - The system shall support the ability to enable/disable Project XML Sync external module.
E.130.200 - The system shall support the ability to enable Project XML Sync external module on all projects by default.
E.130.300 - The system shall support the ability to make Project XML Sync external module discoverable by users.
E.130.400 - The system shall support the ability to allow non-admins to enable Project XML Sync external module on projects.
E.130.500 - The system shall support the ability to hide Project XML Sync external module from non-admins in the list of enabled modules on each project.
E.130.700 - The system shall support the ability to compare a project with an uploaded Project XML and list every design difference without changing the project.
E.130.800 - The system shall support the ability to apply the selected differences to a production project, putting field and instrument changes into Draft Mode and applying all other components directly.
E.130.900 - The system shall list items that exist in the project but not in the uploaded XML as removals that are unselected by default, and shall protect items that hold data.
E.130.1000 - The system shall allow users with Project Design & Setup rights to use Project XML Sync while keeping REDCap's production restrictions and user-right requirements.
E.130.1100 - The system shall log every change applied by Project XML Sync and keep a downloadable report and design backup for each run.
E.130.1200 - The system shall record every configuration change (who changed which setting, when, and from what value to what) for the Project XML Sync external module to the module's View Logs page.
